        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-600 to-emerald-500 rounded-xl p-6 text-white text-center">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold opacity-80 mb-1 tracking-wide">ECONOMIA COM O FATOR R</p>
          <p class="text-4xl font-black mb-1">R$ 1.425 por mês</p>
